{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20137","headline":"送淡公 十 · 孟郊","name":"送淡公 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乡在越镜中，分明见归心。\n镜芳步步绿，镜水日日深。\n异刹碧天上，古香清桂岑。\n朗约徒在昔，章句忽盈今。\n幸因西飞叶，书作东风吟。\n落我病枕上，慰此浮恨侵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20137.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20137","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}